<title>POLAND: POLIGRAFIA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 240,000.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFIA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 240,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
